      "value": "This might not help much but this happens under proton as well, the version of proton I'm using is Proton-RTSP-11.0-20260609-4 , was using version Proton-RTSP-11.0-20260609-3 before I tried -4. I have an Nvidia RTX 4060 Laptop Gpu and an Intel Core i9-14900HX. So it could be a Unity bug or hardware related. However I only got this error as of the recent Open Beta build. The error doesn't seem to happen on the stable version of the game.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
